{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a waiter with the shakiest hand in recorded history! Why in the world did you even choose this job?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shaky Service</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect and deliver meals</strong> to the restaurant's hungry, hungry customers! Beware, however, as <strong>gravity is not your ally</strong>. Shake and tilt too much and down to the floor all that food goes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/531d3b5b2bbb6f9a7ab4a2b659f1112b.poster.avif?t=1768998959\" width=620 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/531d3b5b2bbb6f9a7ab4a2b659f1112b.webm?t=1768998959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/531d3b5b2bbb6f9a7ab4a2b659f1112b.mp4?t=1768998959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race Against Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Those customers won't wait forever</strong>, so make sure you serve them quickly even if you need to be careful with that tray on your way. If you're slow, a couple of <strong>angry table slams</strong> are bound to make things even more difficult for you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/d29ad5ff477e55f9b87164117e19da25.poster.avif?t=1768998959\" width=620 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/d29ad5ff477e55f9b87164117e19da25.webm?t=1768998959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/d29ad5ff477e55f9b87164117e19da25.mp4?t=1768998959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Distractions, Distractions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make matters more challenging, the restaurant floor may be <strong>full of obstacles</strong>, like unsupervised toys and discarded children. Or was it discarded toys and unsupervised children? Either way, <strong>they'll knock that food right off your tray</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/beae89e54283ed52080564a7d82489f5.poster.avif?t=1768998959\" width=620 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/beae89e54283ed52080564a7d82489f5.webm?t=1768998959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/beae89e54283ed52080564a7d82489f5.mp4?t=1768998959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All the World's a Stage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you, as the player, get to enjoy <strong>a variety of the game's stages</strong>, each with <strong>different, increasing challenges</strong>. Get the highest score that you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/7624bce1e5487ed824a20c05069128f5.poster.avif?t=1768998959\" width=620 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/7624bce1e5487ed824a20c05069128f5.webm?t=1768998959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/7624bce1e5487ed824a20c05069128f5.mp4?t=1768998959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put on your best customer service smile and don't let your shaky hand get in your way of a job well done (and a tip generously received).</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3751520?t=1768998959","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/5fd287da1adedd0576ebbf23b4722d0ea9a0dbda/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768998959","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/9f565dc39b0ef1ebda81485b3a369973229a6361/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768998959","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/9f565dc39b0ef1ebda81485b3a369973229a6361/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768998959","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a waiter with the shakiest hand in recorded history! Why in the world did you even choose this job?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shaky Service</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect and deliver meals</strong> to the restaurant's hungry, hungry customers! Beware, however, as <strong>gravity is not your ally</strong>. Shake and tilt too much and down to the floor all that food goes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/531d3b5b2bbb6f9a7ab4a2b659f1112b.poster.avif?t=1768998959\" width=620 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/531d3b5b2bbb6f9a7ab4a2b659f1112b.webm?t=1768998959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/531d3b5b2bbb6f9a7ab4a2b659f1112b.mp4?t=1768998959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race Against Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Those customers won't wait forever</strong>, so make sure you serve them quickly even if you need to be careful with that tray on your way. If you're slow, a couple of <strong>angry table slams</strong> are bound to make things even more difficult for you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/d29ad5ff477e55f9b87164117e19da25.poster.avif?t=1768998959\" width=620 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/d29ad5ff477e55f9b87164117e19da25.webm?t=1768998959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/d29ad5ff477e55f9b87164117e19da25.mp4?t=1768998959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Distractions, Distractions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make matters more challenging, the restaurant floor may be <strong>full of obstacles</strong>, like unsupervised toys and discarded children. Or was it discarded toys and unsupervised children? Either way, <strong>they'll knock that food right off your tray</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/beae89e54283ed52080564a7d82489f5.poster.avif?t=1768998959\" width=620 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/beae89e54283ed52080564a7d82489f5.webm?t=1768998959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/beae89e54283ed52080564a7d82489f5.mp4?t=1768998959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All the World's a Stage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you, as the player, get to enjoy <strong>a variety of the game's stages</strong>, each with <strong>different, increasing challenges</strong>. Get the highest score that you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/7624bce1e5487ed824a20c05069128f5.poster.avif?t=1768998959\" width=620 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/7624bce1e5487ed824a20c05069128f5.webm?t=1768998959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/extras/7624bce1e5487ed824a20c05069128f5.mp4?t=1768998959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put on your best customer service smile and don't let your shaky hand get in your way of a job well done (and a tip generously received).</strong></p>","developers":["Ritual Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751520/3be480d84da5f544b5d6ad4265537df4392f456f/header.jpg?t=1768998959","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3751520/1680038933/139c8144fd8d7cb6f0fcb720a559045584c6a8cb/1750380938/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748621506","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3751520/1680038933/139c8144fd8d7cb6f0fcb720a559045584c6a8cb/1750380938/dash_h264.mpd?t=174862